msgid "The JST-GH-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v. The 9v supply is controlled by either (depending on board version) RELAY 2 set to GPIO 81 or RELAY 3 set to GPIO 82, and they are on by default. These can be configured to be operated by an RC switch or via GCS command (Mission Planner AUX tab)"
